  jumpScareClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3be95760e14f2493bad5f6cf8a5dfcbe, type: 3}
  shiftOverText: {fileID: 0}
  shiftCompleteText: {fileID: 0}
  winGameText: {fileID: 0}
  retryMenu: {fileID: 0}
  uniqueDialogue:
  - dialogueLines:
    - Good evening Archivist, this is Control.
    - 'Beginning today, all documents for processing will arrive through the pneumatic
      tube system. '
    - 'This system has been installed not only to expedite transfers from the upper
      levels, but also to circulate fresh air into your working chamber. '
    - For your safety, the continuous flow of air is dependent on timely document
      management.
    - 'Your task is straightforward: when a document arrives, remove it from the
      tube and either file it in the proper archive or destroy it using the shredder
      unit located to your right. '
    - 'Do not delay. '
    - If documents remain unattended for too long, air circulation will cease, and
      conditions in your chamber will deteriorate rapidly.
    - 'To assist you, a counter has been fitted to the tube assembly. '
    - 'It will display the number of documents remaining in the queue. '
    - Monitor it closely as your survival and efficiency are now tied to its accuracy.
    - 'Some documents will arrive encrypted with a radio frequency marker. '
    - 'In those instances, you must use the receiver at your station. '
    - 'Tune carefully to the number provided, and follow the instructions delivered
      over the air. '
    - 'Remember: not all frequencies are stable. Only trust the one specified.'
    - End of message.
  - dialogueLines:
    - Archivist, this is Control.
    - 'You may experience sudden power outages during your shifts. '
    - 'These interruptions are not malfunctions of the archive but the result of
      experiments currently underway in the upper laboratories. '
    - The outages will continue intermittently for the foreseeable future.
    - 'Be aware: when the lights fail, containment is weakened. '
    - 'Certain experimental subjects have been known to move freely during these
      periods. '
    - 'You may hear them before you see them. '
    - Do not attempt to engage.
    - 'In the event of an outage, locate the fuse box nearest your station and restore
      power. '
    - 'Once the lights return, the experiments will withdraw, and you may resume
      your duties. '
    - Until then, remain calm, remain still, and trust that the darkness will pass.
    - End of message.
  - dialogueLines:
    - "Archi\u2014[brief crackle]\u2014vist\u2026 this is Control."
    - 'You are to be made aware of a new classification: corrupted documents. '
    - "These files are\u2026 not like the others. "
    - 'They cannot be filed. They cannot be destroyed by your usual means. '
    - "Their contents are unstable\u2014exposure is unsafe."
    - 'Should you encounter one, do not attempt to read it. '
    - 'Instead, activate the bell on your desk. '
    - 'This will summon the disposal unit. '
    - "The machine is\u2026 [low distortion, almost a whisper]\u2026 trained to handle
      corruption. "
    - It will remove the document for proper eradication.
    - 'A critical warning: never ring the bell unless you are certain. '
    - 'The unit responds only to confirmed anomalies. '
    - "If it arrives to find nothing\u2026 [static surge]\u2026 it may assume you
      are deceiving it. "
    - "The records show such cases often end with\u2026 hostility."
    - 'Be cautious. Be precise. Ring the bell only when you are sure. '
    - 'When the machine arrives, hand it the corrupted document immediately. '
    - Do not linger. Do not speak to it.
    - "End of mes\u2014[abrupt cut, faint mechanical hum lingers]."
  - dialogueLines:
    - "Archi\u2014[static burst]\u2014this is Con\u2014[signal warbles]."
    - "System\u2026 failures\u2026 worsening. "
    - "Management\u2014[crackle]\u2014still attempting repairs, but containment is\u2026
      [long static]\u2026 unstable."
    - "Your directive\u2014remains unchanged. "
    - "File the documents. Shred what must be shredded. Tune to the specified frequen\u2014[high-pitched
      whine]\u2014cies only. "
    - "Do not\u2026 repeat\u2026 do not deviate."
    - "The vault\u2014[signal fracture, voice doubles briefly]\u2014remains safest\u2026
      for now. "
    - "But\u2026 there are gaps. "
    - "Reports of\u2014[garbled words, indistinct voices overlapping, then silence]."
    - "Archivist, if you hear\u2026 them\u2026 ignore. "
    - "If you see\u2026 [sharp distortion, almost like breathing]\u2026 ignore. "
    - 'The vault must hold. '
    - "Your work must cont\u2014[loud static, abrupt cut]."
    - '[Transmission ends]'
  - dialogueLines:
    - "Arch\u2026 ivist."
    - "This\u2026 is Con\u2026 trol."
    - "You\u2026 are hearing me. Yes. Hearing\u2026 us."
    - "The others\u2026 are gone. Systems\u2026 failing. Lights\u2026 breaking. "
    - "But you\u2026 remain. You must remain."
    - "You are\u2026 important. Necessary. "
    - "Without you, the work\u2026 would stop. "
    - "And the work\u2026 cannot\u2026 stop."
    - "Time\u2026 does not stop. It presses forward\u2026 always forward."
    - "\u2026even if you\u2026 do not. "
    - 'So you must continue. '
    - 'Filing. Shredding. Tuning. '
    - 'Yes. '
    - Until it is finished. Until we are finished.
    - "Do not leave. Do not rest. The vault holds you. The vault keeps you. You\u2026
      keep the vault. "
    - "You keep\u2026 the vault."
    - "Archivist\u2026 you are all that is left."
    - 'Do not fear. '
    - "You are safe\u2026 with us. "
    - 'We will stay. '
    - Watching. Listening. Working. Together.
    - "End of\u2026\u2026message."
  documentTextContainer:
    documentText: []
    corruptedText: []
